// Purpose: Regression tests for slice-view semantics under the fat-slice
//          header ABI (comp_error.md #114). Every s[a:b] — including
//          strict prefixes s[0:k] and multiple live views sharing the
//          same start offset with different lengths — produces an
//          independent slice header sharing the backing allocation.
